      "parameters" : {
        "value" : "An explorable, original high-fantasy world seen from a traveler’s eye level. Begin on a weathered stone road outside a vast hilltop castle. The castle fills the central distance and its arched gate is visible slightly to the right, with towers, market banners, ancient trees, mountains, and warm late-afternoon light. Include clear landmarks. Each new view should move into the subject selected from the previous view’s planned layout, revealing plausible nearby details and inviting further exploration. Invent only the next local view as needed; do not predefine a complete world map."
