      "id" : "imageEditGuide",
      "kind" : "edit.markdownNote",
      "parameters" : {
        "text" : "## Plan-A image-conditioned navigation\n\nThis copy sends the previous scene plan and rendered frame into the next loop pass. Navigation Crop centers the selected Trackpad X\/Y region; FLUX.2 conditions its next image on that crop and the new Qwen prompt. First frame is text-to-image. The Persistent Character and Style text joins the parsed scene prompt only after Qwen3 finishes, so Qwen3 does not generate the repeated image brief.\n\nThis graph is linked to the complete FLUX.2 Klein 4B macOS export. Select `~\/coreai-models\/exports-image-conditioned\/FLUX.2-klein-4B` in Pipeline Editor. It must include `VAEEncoder.aimodel` and `Transformer.aimodel` with `img2img_half`. If using another export, relink the FLUX.2 node to its package identity. The earlier three-component export is text-only and cannot execute later frames.\n\nThe original text-only Plan-A example remains available."
      },
      "resources" : {

      },
